{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brew is an action-packed roguelite that emphasizes quick thinking and resource management in the midst of battle. With an intuitive crafting system, you can create an abundance of different potions to aid you in attempting your alchemy exams!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793330/extras/Gameplay_Title__1_.png?t=1741961356\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather ingredients and brew them up into powerful potions in the midst of battle! Use the potions to climb further into The Tower, by drinking and temporarily boosting yourself, throwing to affect the enemies and environment around you, or loading into your weapon to upgrade your potion gun! Achieve mastery over alchemy by utilizing potion abilities to create fierce combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793330/extras/MouseRun.gif?t=1741961356\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793330/extras/Brew_your_own_playstyl_Title__1_.png?t=1741961356\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock hundreds of unique badges and learn new potion recipes to create your own unique playstyle! With a wide variety of potion upgrades, character skills and secret rooms inside The Tower to unlock, you will feel like a true alchemy student learning new abilities after every class!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793330/extras/OpenChest.gif?t=1741961356\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793330/extras/Life_at_the_academy_Title__1_.png?t=1741961356\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get to know your fellow classmates and professors. Converse with them, try to impress them with a gift or spend your days hanging out with them! Deepening your friendships is the key to enjoying the student life at the Alchemy Academy! Who knows? You might even find that special someone\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793330/extras/Friends.gif?t=1741961356\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1793330?t=1741961356","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1793330?t=1741961356","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793330/4cfa3a68e065a31ee61d89d0f3d0801bf1ec97ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741961356","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793330/4cfa3a68e065a31ee61d89d0f3d0801bf1ec97ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741961356","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3511800,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brew is an action-packed roguelite that emphasizes quick thinking and resource management in the midst of battle. With an intuitive crafting system, you can create an abundance of different potions to aid you in attempting your alchemy exams!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793330/extras/Gameplay_Title__1_.png?t=1741961356\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather ingredients and brew them up into powerful potions in the midst of battle! Use the potions to climb further into The Tower, by drinking